srd:
    1: # TalentWorld (TWORLD) - System Requirements Document
    2  ## Version 4.0 - Final Locked (No Platform Fees)

    9  ### 1. Overview
   10: TalentWorld lets one account wear multiple Hats. A Hat = professional identity + hiring intent. Split-file architecture: MyHats, BentoCard, Showroom, Profile, Dashboard.
   11  

   24  ### 2. User Flow - Registration to Accepting Payment
   25: **Diagram:** See `TalentWorld_UserFlow_v4.png` - 3 swimlanes: Talent (Creator) Blue, Client (Employer) Black, System Green.
   26  

   43  **Step 4: Browse Feed**
   44: - Role toggle at top: Creator pill and Employer pill. Persists in localStorage `talentworld_role`.
   45  - If Creator → system shows Client cards (black pill). If Employer → shows Talent cards (blue #0A13E6 pill).

  138  - Showroom split file: Showroom_SPLIT_Improved (260px, custom orbit, toggle)
  139: - Flow diagram: TalentWorld_UserFlow_v4.png
